   "text": "Most funnels break before the first email goes out.\n\nNot in the copy. In 8 decisions nobody wrote down.\n\nI learned this the slow way. For years every new client meant the same manual process, run again by hand. It felt like building a house without a solid foundation.\n\nHere are the 8 decisions every page, email and invite depends on:\n\n1. Offer: what you sell, in one sentence\n2. Method: the name for how you deliver it\n3. Value: the one doubt a buyer has, answered\n4. Buyer: one persona, named narrowly\n5. List: clean prospects you can reach\n6. Funnel: the one funnel you will build\n7. Date: the event topic, day and time\n8. Channels: every account connected\n\nWrite all 8 into one doc before you build anything. Then every page, email and invite is written from the same decisions.\n\nThat's Day 1 of the 3-Day AI RevOps Workshop. The next cohort starts tomorrow, Wed 28 Oct, at 11:00 AM ET. Registration closes tonight at 23:59 ET.\n\nWhich of the 8 does your team skip?",
